pkg:Evidence_v1_26_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.26.0 (STORY-12 closed -- MS-Explorer redesign)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: user attached the actual rendered sidebar text, showing raw ontology identifiers stacked with every label, and a genuine second flat duplicate of the tree in the middle panel, distinct from the 'All Sections' block already removed. Fixed: removed visible raw IDs (kept in aria-label/title only), added folder/document icons, and implemented real folder-click filtering -- clicking a category now genuinely filters the middle list to its own contents with a count and reset control, replacing what had been an always-everything static duplicate. One real authoring bug (invalid backslash-escaped template syntax) caught by re-reading the written file directly, not assumed correct, and fixed. Re-verified via real Playwright exercising the actual new interaction: 0 errors. Version bumped correctly this turn, before committing -- applying the lesson from the prior two drift corrections proactively: all 4 stages moved to v1_6_0, Cross.D verified as a single version before any commit. Re-verified: all Stage1-3 gates PASS fresh, pipeline order (41 subjects, reproduces), full SHACL 0 violations."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "ab6dd70e04b59e6e518e38746d708ce55d1cc1a4586a390f5cd84ec8c5191dc7"^^xsd:string .
